Author: Hadi Fariborzi [aut, cre], Piers Steel [aut], Amirhossein Saeidmehr [aut]
Maintainer: Hadi Fariborzi <hadi@hubmeta.com>
Description: Tools for psychometric meta-analysis and partial
    meta-analytic correlation-matrix completion. The package currently
    includes Hunter-Schmidt style pooling, Morris-weight meta-analysis,
    and early MICA utilities for diagnosing, completing, and triaging
    incomplete correlation matrices before downstream multivariate
    modeling.
